Gen 50:1 , The mourning for Jacob;
Gen 50:4 , Joseph gets leave of Pharaoh to go to bury him;
Gen 50:7 , The funeral;
Gen 50:15 , Joseph comforts his brethren, who crave his pardon;
Gen 50:22 , His age;
Gen 50:23 , He sees the third generation of his sons;
Gen 50:24 , He prophesies unto his brethren of their return;
Gen 50:25 , He takes an oath of them concerning his bones;
Gen 50:26 , He dies, and is put into a coffin.
